            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "Ebike design and Frame material",
            "text": "<p> The MACFOX-M20X boasts an ergonomically engineered design that prioritizes rider comfort, while its aerodynamic structure minimizes wind drag for a smooth ride. Enjoy an uncomplicated journey each time you venture out.</p><p>Further enhancing its design is a high-strength steel frame. This durable construction offers remarkable stability and resilience, maintaining its shape even under challenging conditions. With the M20X, experience a dependable ride that's built to last.</p>",
